. My answer to the above issues are as under:-
Issue No.1 : In the Affirmative;
(SCCH-9) 8 MVC.No.2477/2021 Issue No.2 : Partly in the Affirmative; Issue No.3 :

let me discuss one by one:
a) Towards Injury, Pain and Suffering: The petitioner has contended due to accident he was sustained compound type - II fracture left proximal 1/3rd tibia and fibula,
crush injury left foot (fracture proximal phalanx of 3rd toe and distal phalanx of 5th toe), fracture of 5th metacarpal base of left hand and he underwent with 4 th toe amputation external fixation for fracture 1/3rd tibia, debridement with 4th toe amputation with K-wiring for crush injury left foot on 15.03.2021, debridement external fixation realignment on 25.03.2021, external fixation removal + ORIF with lateral LCP fixation + medial gastrocnemius flap coverage + SSG + ICBG on 2.4.2021 (SCCH-9) 13 MVC.No.2477/2021 and discharged him on 23.04.2021.
